<!doctype html>
<html class="dark" lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"><meta content="dark" name="color-scheme"><meta content="Callum Ingley&#39;s Living Engineering Resume covering career experience, skills, and education." name="description"><title>Living Resume | dev_ing</title><link href="/static/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"><link as="font" crossorigin href="/static/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.woff2" rel="preload" type="font/woff2"></head><body class="bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur"><div class="site-header-inner"><a class="site-brand" href="/"><span class="text-orange-500">dev</span><span>_ing</span></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><ul class="site-nav-list" role="list"><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/">Home</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/projects">Projects</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/blog">Blog</a></li><li><a aria-current="page" class="nav-link nav-link-active text-orange-500 font-semibold" href="/resume">Resume</a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main class="site-main" id="main-content"><!-- lustre:fragment --><div class="bento-section-header mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">03 // LIVING RESUME</p><h1 class="bento-section-title text-zinc-50">Callum Ingley</h1><p class="bento-section-subtitle text-zinc-400">Full-Stack Software Engineer — Web, Mobile &amp; Functional Systems</p></div><div class="bento-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-2 bg-zinc-900 border-orange-500/40 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">PROFILE // Newcastle, NSW</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Engineering Summary</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-zinc-400">Software engineer with experience across full-stack TypeScript web platforms, cross-platform mobile apps, cloud services, and functional programming in Gleam. Always learning and exploring modern developer tooling such as Git and Jujutsu (jj) to build clean, reliable software.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="bento-link" href="mailto:callum.ingley@gmail.com">callum.ingley@gmail.com</a><a class="bento-link" href="https://github.com/kazlim-code" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub Profile</a></div></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-1 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">ACADEMIC</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Education</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0">The University of Western Australia (UWA)</h3><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Bachelor of Science — Computer &amp; Mathematical Sciences</p><p class="text-xs font-mono text-orange-500">Perth, WA</p></div></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">CAPABILITIES</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Technical Skills</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><section class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0 text-orange-500">Languages</h3><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Gleam</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">JavaScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">SQL</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Swift</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Kotlin</span></li></ul></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0 text-orange-500">Web &amp; Mobile</h3><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Lustre</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Wisp</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Vue</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Nuxt</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Capacitor</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Tailwind CSS</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">HTML5 &amp; CSS3</span></li></ul></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0 text-orange-500">Backend, Cloud &amp; Data</h3><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">BEAM / Erlang</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Mist</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">PostgreSQL</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">AWS</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">AWS Amplify</span></li></ul></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0 text-orange-500">Tooling &amp; Practices</h3><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Jujutsu (jj)</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Git</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">GitHub / GitLab</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Storybook</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">TDD &amp; Snapshot Testing</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Neovim</span></li></ul></section></div></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">2025 – 2026 · Australia (Remote)</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Software Engineer — Grafa</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li>Delivered full-stack web features and financial data views in TypeScript and Nuxt</li><li>Collaborated on backend API integration, PostgreSQL queries, and AWS workflows</li><li>Improved maintainability with modular component patterns and automated checks</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Nuxt</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Vue</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">PostgreSQL</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">AWS</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">2024 – 2025 · Australia (Remote)</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Software Engineer — Wyrd Technology</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li>Built cross-platform web and mobile applications using Vue, TypeScript, and Capacitor</li><li>Implemented native iOS and Android bridge integrations in Swift, Kotlin, and Xcode</li><li>Streamlined release pipelines and UI consistency across mobile form factors</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Vue</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Capacitor</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Swift</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Kotlin</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Xcode</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">2021 – 2024 · Perth / Newcastle, Australia</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Full-Stack Developer — Grafa</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li>Engineered core web application features and reusable UI components with Storybook</li><li>Worked across AWS Amplify, PostgreSQL, and REST APIs tested with Postman</li><li>Partnered with product and design teams using Jira and Confluence</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">JavaScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Vue</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Nuxt</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">PostgreSQL</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">AWS Amplify</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Storybook</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">2018 – 2020 · Perth, WA</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Software &amp; Systems Contributor — Akora Property</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li>Supported web tooling, structured data management, and operational workflows</li><li>Automated reporting and internal process improvements across property operations</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">JavaScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">HTML5 &amp; CSS3</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Git</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">2010 – 2018 · Perth, WA</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Digital Production &amp; Technical Operations — The West Australian</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li>Contributed to high-cadence digital publishing and production workflows</li><li>Collaborated across multidisciplinary editorial and technical teams under strict deadlines</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Web Publishing</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Digital Media</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Team Collaboration</span></li></ul></div></article></div><!-- /lustre:fragment --></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-foo